+/// keys (W4).
+///
+/// Every entry below was written and checked by hand against the key's
+/// English meaning (the curated `MGKeysTable` row or the Apple Wiki
+/// description). Nothing here is machine translation copied in
+/// unchecked, and nothing is guessed: keys without a reviewed entry
+/// simply have no Chinese name, and the UI must show
+/// `missingChineseNameLabel` ("暂无中文名") for them instead of
+/// inventing a translation.
