+/// Coverage: all 77 curated keys (`MGKeysTable.all`) plus 45 widely
+/// used Apple Wiki keys (device identity, radios, cameras, display),
+/// 122 keys in total. The remaining ~820 Apple Wiki keys keep their
+/// English plain name until a reviewer translates them.
